---
description: Serena LSP symbolic code tools (TypeScript/Bun, Python, Go)
alwaysApply: true
---

Projeto configurado com [Serena](https://oraios.github.io/serena/) em `.serena/`.

**Language servers ativos:** `typescript` (TS/JS + **Bun**), `python`, `go` (gopls).

| Stack | LSP Serena | Notas |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Backend Bun + frontend Astro | `typescript` | Não há LSP "bun" separado; `@types/bun` cobre tipos |
| Graphify / scripts Python | `python` | Pyright via `uvx` |
| Go (`backend/services/` futuro) | `go` | Requer `gopls` em PATH ou `ls_specific_settings.go.ls_path` |

**Ferramentas MCP:** `get_symbols_overview`, `find_symbol`, `find_referencing_symbols`, `rename_symbol`, `replace_symbol_body`.

**Ordem de exploração:** graphify → Serena → Read/Grep pontual.

```bash
npm run serena:check   # health-check + memories
npm run serena:index   # reindexar símbolos TS
```

Após editar `.serena/project.yml`: reiniciar MCP Serena no Cursor.
